    "detailed_description": "A squad based game where the player takes the role of a healer in a Whac-A-Mole attempt to keep the squad alive through healing, enchantment, and offensive spells to vanquish hordes of green skins.<br><br><strong>Feature</strong><br>Inspired from my time playing a healbot in World of Warcraft, player will gather a group of up to 30 units and 10 spells to beat the tide of green skins. Gather gold from the defeated enemies and replace your fallen with better and more powerful units as you go up against deadlier foes.<br><br>Yishi currently has 30 different unit types (15 green skins and 15 playable human units) and 15 spells types (with 5 secret combo spells, amped up versions of the normal spells but only available to be triggered during battle by using a select sequence of spells) for players to choose from, in a never ending war with the green skin horde.",
    "about_the_game": "A squad based game where the player takes the role of a healer in a Whac-A-Mole attempt to keep the squad alive through healing, enchantment, and offensive spells to vanquish hordes of green skins.<br><br><strong>Feature</strong><br>Inspired from my time playing a healbot in World of Warcraft, player will gather a group of up to 30 units and 10 spells to beat the tide of green skins. Gather gold from the defeated enemies and replace your fallen with better and more powerful units as you go up against deadlier foes.<br><br>Yishi currently has 30 different unit types (15 green skins and 15 playable human units) and 15 spells types (with 5 secret combo spells, amped up versions of the normal spells but only available to be triggered during battle by using a select sequence of spells) for players to choose from, in a never ending war with the green skin horde.",
